    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1963-p29.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "The vertex occurs at \\(t=-\\frac{160}{2\\cdot-16}=5.\\) Then \\[s(5)=160(5)-16(25)=400.\\]\n\nThus, the correct answer is C.",
      "hints": [
        "The height is a downward-opening quadratic",
        "Find its vertex time using \\(-\\frac{b}{2a}\\)"
